ive  the lady and her son arrive and they  install all their devices to communicate  with the beyond then everyone sits the  table and the lady begins to ask if  there is a spirit in the house  after asking several times the monster  appears and attacks the lady at that  moment finn's parents arrive and when  they turn on the lights the monster  leaves  finn's parents asked the lady to leave  so she and her son do so finn's parents  ask him for an explanation but finn  decides to run away from home with lena  and samira finn lena and samira leave in  a car and look for a place to spend the  night meanwhile finn's parents go to see  sophie and realize she has a fever so  they decide to call the doctor  lena tells finn that she is very scared  about the monster and that she thinks  this might be their last night spent  together  so finn samira and lena decide to have a  threesome the next day finn and the  girls go to look for the lady to finish  the ritual  however when they get to her house a man  tells them that the lady and her son  left during the night and that they did  not plan to return  finn samira and lena decide to go to  school as usual there finn decides to  call his mom and tell her that he's fine  and also asks how sofi is to which his  mom replies that she's fine thanks to  the doctor who increased the dose of her  medicine  finn meets up with lena and samira when  they suddenly see a boy jump off a roof  they call an ambulance and both finn and  samir decide to get into the ambulance  with the boy  on the way to the hospital finn sees the  boy spit out a mushroom similar to the  one in his pills  meanwhile alina discovers that such  pills are sold by a new drug brand and  that there will be an event promoting it  lena decides to go to this event and  there she realizes these pills are being  promoted as if they were a solution to  make young people more sociable and  intelligent  she also realizes the director of the  company that sells the pills as 